      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The noble deals [[/r 1d6[Precision]]]{1d6 extra precision damage} to @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Flat-Footed} creatures.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When the monster Strikes a creature that has the flat-footed condition with an agile or finesse melee weapon, an agile or finesse unarmed attack, or a ranged weapon attack, it also deals the listed precision damage. For a ranged attack with a thrown weapon, that weapon must also be an agile or finesse weapon.</p>"
        },
